      "your_filter_output_is_barely_trickling": "Your filter output is barely trickling. Debris has built up in the intake and media. Without filtration, ammonia will spike quickly.",
      "your_heater_thermostat_is_stuck_on_hig": "Your heater thermostat is stuck on high! Water temperature is climbing rapidly toward 88°F. Your fish are showing signs of thermal stress.",
