      "iconic_but_lower_omega_3_than_fatty_fi": "Iconic but lower omega-3 than fatty fish. Excellent protein, low fat.",
      "if_a_friend_s_health_or_safety_is_at_r": "If a friend's health or safety is at risk — they've mentioned hurting themselves, are passing out, can't function in daily life, or you're seriously worried — tell a trusted adult right away. Telling someone who can help is not a betrayal; it's the most loyal thing a friend can do. NEDA, school counselors, and parents are all good places to start.",
      "if_reading_about_eating_concerns_is_ha": "If reading about eating concerns is hard for you right now, ",
      "if_this_is_post_exercise_or_after_illn": "If this is post-exercise or after illness, rehydrate with water + a salty snack or oral rehydration solution.",
      "if_you_are_struggling_with_mental_heal": "If you are struggling with mental health, please reach out to a doctor, therapist, school counselor, or trusted adult. Crisis support is available 24/7: ",
      "if_you_find_yourself_using_water_to_fe": "If you find yourself using water to feel \"full\" or override hunger, that is a body-cue mismatch worth talking about with a trusted adult. NEDA helpline: 1-800-931-2237.",
      "if_you_re_in_crisis_right_now": "If you're in crisis right now ",
      "if_you_re_the_one_struggling": "If you're the one struggling",
      "if_you_ve_been_on_a_platform_for_30_mi": "If you've been on a platform for 30 minutes and feel worse about yourself than when you started, close it. Body comparison is one of the most well-documented harms of social media.",
      "important": "⚠ Important: ",
      "important_caution": "⚠ Important caution",
      "important_framing": "Important framing",
      "in_2022_maine_became_the_second_state_": "In 2022, Maine became the second state in the U.S. (after California) to permanently fund free school breakfast and lunch for ALL public-school students, regardless of family income. The law (LD 1679, signed by Governor Mills) eliminated the means-tested application process and the social stigma that came with it. Other states have since followed.",
      "in_many_states_and_online_anyone_can_c": "In many states (and online), anyone can call themselves a \"nutritionist.\" The term is unregulated. There are real certified nutrition professionals (CNS — Certified Nutrition Specialist), but there are also Instagram \"nutritionists\" with no formal training selling supplements and meal plans.",
      "in_rural_maine_the_nearest_grocery_sto": "In rural Maine, the nearest grocery store with fresh produce can be 30+ minutes away. Without a car, that's functionally inaccessible.",
      "in_school": "In school: ",
