      "falmouth_gazette_and_weekly_advertiser_2": "Falmouth Gazette and Weekly Advertiser",
      "festina_lente_make_haste_but_slowly_a_": "“Festina lente — make haste, but slowly. A pocket book that pirates copy is still my book.”",
      "field_trip": "Field trip",
