      "gutenberg_came_from_the_family_estate_": "\"Gutenberg\" came from the family estate \"zum Gutenberg\" in Mainz. Johannes Gensfleisch zur Laden zum Gutenberg is the full name. We remember the street he lived on, not his birth name.",
      "gutenberg_s_actual_surname_was_gensfle": "Gutenberg's actual surname was Gensfleisch.",
      "hammer_book": "Hammer + book",
      "help_sort_the_type_silently_do_not_say": "Help sort the type silently. Do not say who dropped it.",
      "helvetica_4": "Helvetica",
      "hire_a_replacement_immediately_even_if": "Hire a replacement immediately, even if less skilled.",
      "his_older_brother_james_was_a_boston_p": "His older brother James was a Boston printer who took Ben on as an apprentice at age 12. Five years in, Ben fled to Philadelphia rather than finish the term. The legal apprenticeship contract he broke is the same kind of contract you read above. He spent the rest of his life as a printer first and a politician second.",
      "householder_of_this_city_has_taken_int": ", householder of this city, has taken into his service ",
      "i_write_to_you_in_my_own_hand_which_th": "I write to you in my own hand, which the Master says shows promise, though my fingers still ache from the cold of the morning. The shop is busy with the Bible. I have not seen any of the printed pages up close; the apprentices are not yet trusted to touch them. But I see them stacked under cloth in the back room. There must be thousands. The Master's shop has more books in it now than any cathedral library I have ever heard of.",
      "if_the_apprentice_runs_away": "If the apprentice runs away",
      "in_your_school_context_which_signals_i": " in your school context? Which signals \"I am being playful?\" Where did you learn that?",
