      "newer_press": "Newer press →",
      "newspapers": "Newspapers",
      "newspapers_did_not_exist_for_150_years": "Newspapers did not exist for 150 years after Gutenberg. The first periodicals (1605 Strasbourg, 1622 London) invented how to publish news weekly. Walk through 4 historic front pages and the choices each editor made.",
      "newton_s_principia_mathematica_1687": "Newton's Principia Mathematica (1687)",
