      "oral_traditions_backed_by_trained_memo": "Oral traditions backed by trained memory keepers. Stories, treaty histories, place-names, plant knowledge, navigation, and seasonal cycles were carried by individuals who specialized in remembering. Oral does not mean unreliable; specialist memorizers were checked against each other and against material artifacts.",
