      "lie_or_kneel_on_a_stable_surface_dock_": "Lie or kneel on a stable surface (dock, shore, edge of pool). Extend a pole, branch, oar, towel, shirt, or even your leg. Stay anchored — do not let the victim pull you in. Pull them to safety hand-over-hand.",
