      "build_things_set_your_own_hours_varied": "Build things, set your own hours, varied projects",
      "building_tig_skills_portfolio_networki": "Building TIG skills + portfolio. Networking with shops.",
      "buildings_dead_load_structures": "Buildings, dead-load structures.",
