      "major_fume_constituents_by_metal": "Major fume constituents by metal",
      "manganese_exposure": "Manganese exposure: ",
      "many_maine_ctes_region_10_mid_coast_sc": "Many Maine CTEs (Region 10, Mid-Coast School of Technology, Hancock County Technical Center) feed BIW directly. Counselors have established relationships.",
      "many_maine_welders_eventually_open_the": "Many Maine welders eventually open their own shops — sometimes after 5-15 years industry experience, sometimes immediately from CTE/EMCC. Small shop welding is hard work but it is one of the lowest-barrier paths to small business ownership.",
      "many_welders_estimated_20_are_dyslexic": "Many welders (estimated 20%+) are dyslexic, ADHD, autistic, or have other neurodivergent profiles. Welding rewards visual-spatial thinking + focused attention + tactile skill — often a great fit. Reasonable accommodations are protected by ADA. Common requests: written instructions, quieter break area, predictable schedule.",
      "marcus_t": "Marcus T.",
      "marine_fabrication_shops": "Marine + fabrication shops: ",
      "massive_setup_cost_chamber_support_shi": "Massive setup cost (chamber + support ship). Long mobilization time. Decompression schedule for diver. Niche specialty — fewer jobs.",
