      "mig_gun_with_built_in_extraction_port_": "MIG gun with built-in extraction port. Heavier gun + needs hose to extractor. Excellent — captures at source.",
      "mig_machine_miller_211_lincoln_210mp_1": "MIG machine (Miller 211 / Lincoln 210MP ~$1,200-1,500), TIG/stick combo (Miller Multimatic 220 ~$2,500), oxy-acetylene rig (~$500), grinder, plasma cutter (~$1,000), helmet, gloves, cart, vise, table. Used equipment cuts cost 30-50%.",
      "mig_vs_tig_vs_stick_vs_oxy": "MIG vs TIG vs Stick vs Oxy",
