      "time_per_foot_of_weld_number_of_feet_s": "Time-per-foot of weld × number of feet + setup time + cleanup. Include grinding, fitting, tacking.",
      "time_pressure_precision_welding": "Time-pressure precision welding",
      "timed_precision_welding": "Timed precision welding",
